<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson shares fall on Motorola report.</title>
<headline>Ericsson shares fall on Motorola report.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Swedish telecoms giant LM Ericsson AB sunk on Wednesday afternoon after rival Motorola painted a bleak outlook for the third quarter of the year.</p>
<p>Ericsson slumped four crowns or 2.5 percent to 156.50 crowns after the report was released.</p>
<p>Motorola said sales and order patterns in July and August indicated that earnings for the third quarter may be significantly below those of the second quarter and significantly below analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
